1
00:01:56,865 --> 00:02:05,835
contact us: turkision@gmail.com

2
00:02:12,010 --> 00:02:15,049
Yakup Bey,sent his daughter to Konya
for a reason.

3
00:02:16,031 --> 00:02:19,300
He wants to declare his own sultanate
and take oaths of loyalty.

4
00:02:20,730 --> 00:02:22,639
Then the seal...

5
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:26,279
He will use it to gather the beys behind him.

6
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:31,639
Maybe a document to promote his sultanate...

7
00:02:33,920 --> 00:02:38,799
Son, go to Yenisehir and
tell your father what's going on.

8
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:43,639
Let Osman Bey ruin their plans.

9
00:02:53,740 --> 00:02:55,559
Let me kiss, mother.

10
00:02:58,440 --> 00:03:00,199
Have a safe journey, Alaaddin Ali.

11
00:03:00,690 --> 00:03:03,839
Thanks, mother. Thanks.

12
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,589
Food!

13
00:04:15,050 --> 00:04:18,519
Master Vasillis. I knew it.

14
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:23,239
Osman Bey, why are you so furious?

15
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:28,799
Who are you comparing me with?
How dare you standing against me?

16
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:34,758
I'm neither Vizier Alemshah who you beheaded...

17
00:04:35,239 --> 00:04:39,599
...nor Ismihan Hatun who you sent to exile.

18
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:47,319
I'm not here to gain power.

19
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:54,519
My power is already beyond everybody.

20
00:04:56,400 --> 00:05:03,159
My homeland is already prosperous.
I came to put the frontiers in order.

21
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:07,479
I was already a sultan.

22
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:13,279
My sultanate is just stating the obvious.

23
00:05:14,190 --> 00:05:16,359
Answer my question.

24
00:05:18,460 --> 00:05:20,889
But while answering

25
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:26,079
...take a warning from the names you counted.

26
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:31,839
I only take lessons, not warnings.

27
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:37,159
They tolerated you too much, obviously.

28
00:05:38,090 --> 00:05:39,769
I won't.

29
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:45,829
Why are you holding a dagger then?

30
00:05:51,780 --> 00:05:56,379
If I had a dagger, I wouldn't hide it.

31
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:01,649
I was hiding your mistake.

32
00:06:03,550 --> 00:06:08,169
What mistake? What mistake would I even make?

33
00:06:12,610 --> 00:06:16,959
It was the dagger of the person
who attempted to kill me, Osman Bey.

34
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:25,399
I thought you were on my side.
I never thought you would ambush me.

35
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:31,239
But you didn't think we were allies.

36
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:37,799
And now you are slandering?
What game are you talking about?

37
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:44,519
Here is the proof! If there are any slanders,
it's you who are casting them.

38
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:52,839
Who knows with which heathen’s words
you are calling me to account?

39
00:07:01,340 --> 00:07:03,799
You can't fool me.

40
00:07:04,620 --> 00:07:08,279
But you are already fooled.

41
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:11,959
You brought it to use as a leverage.

42
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:15,679
And now you are even talking about a game?

43
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:30,839
Before you accuse someone,
clean the dirt on your hands first.

44
00:07:33,420 --> 00:07:39,319
Maybe, the dirt came one me when
you tried to make me kiss your hand.

45
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:44,279
Oh no, Beys! People expect unity from us.

46
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:48,119
This is not a good time.
Stop this.

47
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:55,399
It wouldn't suit you, Beys.
You are pioneers. Don't do this.

48
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:58,959
This wouldn't end up well.

49
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:09,159
You'll come to the opening of the market
and correct your mistake.

50
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:15,879
My sultanate will spread to the whole land.

51
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:22,039
You will come and pledge loyalty.

52
00:08:27,890 --> 00:08:29,549
We are leaving!

53
00:08:33,190 --> 00:08:36,739
You can't just say your words and then leave!

54
00:08:40,210 --> 00:08:43,399
What is this supposed to mean, Osman Bey?

55
00:08:55,809 --> 00:08:58,159
Like Beys said,

56
00:09:01,890 --> 00:09:05,319
...people shouldn't think we are at odds.

57
00:09:07,740 --> 00:09:09,989
Let me walk to the yard with you.

58
00:09:37,460 --> 00:09:43,079
Alright then. See you
in the market tomorrow, hatuns.

59
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:49,159
Malhun Hatun, you should come
and see your stall too.

60
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:55,279
Everybody's stall is ready.
If you're late, you remain hungry.

61
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:57,839
I will come Saadet Hatun.
Don't worry.

62
00:09:58,350 --> 00:10:00,639
I care about my people, of course.

63
00:10:04,250 --> 00:10:10,579
Princess Holofira, I'd like to host you
in my market before you leave.

64
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:13,959
Obviously, you are good at trading.

65
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:18,399
Holofira must have other things to do.
Another time, if Allah permits.

66
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:23,919
Does the lady not have a tongue,
Malhun Hatun?

67
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:30,919
I will definitely come by
before I leave, Saadet Hatun.

68
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:42,159
I got a nice stall prepared
in the market for the Kayi rugs.

69
00:10:42,520 --> 00:10:45,639
Coins will fill in your pouches.

70
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:58,419
Holofira go to my room and wait for me.

71
00:11:05,900 --> 00:11:09,999
My mother doesn't like someone talking
over her words, Holofira.

72
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:12,399
Go there now.

73
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:19,279
Only a cup.

74
00:11:22,060 --> 00:11:23,959
Another cup.

75
00:12:01,660 --> 00:12:05,319
-Your captivity is over, Remus.
-Thank God.

76
00:12:05,630 --> 00:12:12,449
You'll get out of the palace. But first,
Master Vasillis has another mission for you.

77
00:13:21,690 --> 00:13:24,359
Did you get hosted well, Saadet Hatun?

78
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:28,439
Thankfully, Malhun Hatun
provided everything for us.

79
00:13:29,330 --> 00:13:33,039
-Thank you, Osman Bey.
-Thank you, thank you.

80
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:38,239
Tonight your tranquility protected you, Osman Bey.

81
00:13:38,560 --> 00:13:41,719
Don't count on my tranquility too much!

82
00:13:44,380 --> 00:13:48,759
It may be overwhelmed by my wrath any time.

83
00:13:50,810 --> 00:13:56,279
If you get overwhelmed by your wrath,
you will be a loser forever.

84
00:13:58,460 --> 00:14:00,479
Stay safe.

85
00:14:18,690 --> 00:14:20,679
Osman Bey!

86
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:24,759
Just pledge loyalty.

87
00:14:29,260 --> 00:14:33,959
I'm both older and more powerful than you.

88
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:39,999
Stop being arrogant so we both will be safe.

89
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:43,649
Those fighting for Allah never get arrogant!

90
00:14:45,140 --> 00:14:50,679
I hope your cause of fight is always
to spread Allah's words! Stay safe!

91
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:09,799
Why did we stop, my Bey?

92
00:15:11,210 --> 00:15:13,449
What happened, Osman?

93
00:15:21,930 --> 00:15:25,599
Someone tried to assassinate Yakup Bey.

94
00:15:27,110 --> 00:15:32,039
And the one who tried to assassinate
him had this Kayi's dagger.

95
00:15:32,510 --> 00:15:38,119
Hatuns' table was not peaceful either.
Apparently, there will be discomfort.

96
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:43,479
I think it is a game, my Bey.
If he had this before, he would use it.

97
00:15:43,850 --> 00:15:47,359
He took it out when he was in trouble.
We should've handled it when we had him.

98
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:53,359
Knowing where to stop is better than
making a move, my son

99
00:15:54,580 --> 00:15:56,519
Konur arrived just in time.

100
00:15:57,100 --> 00:16:02,359
Yakup Bey's son Mehmet surrounded
Yenisehir with an army.

101
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:06,599
They have no fear.

102
00:16:09,950 --> 00:16:12,519
I should go and check Holofira.

103
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:20,239
If they shed any blood, the peace and union
in Yenisehir would disappear.

104
00:16:20,700 --> 00:16:23,679
-What about our reputation, my Bey?
-Orhan!

105
00:16:24,670 --> 00:16:29,559
What if we shed blood at dinner? What would happen then?

106
00:16:29,800 --> 00:16:33,159
Would our reputation be in its place?

107
00:16:34,040 --> 00:16:39,199
We know this... but what about people?
How could our people support us?

108
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:48,679
Start a fire.

109
00:16:49,640 --> 00:16:52,389
It will be a long night.

110
00:17:06,150 --> 00:17:10,839
These roads are not safe
for a girl like you, Holofira.

111
00:17:12,080 --> 00:17:15,439
This place is nothing like
the place you came from.

112
00:17:16,390 --> 00:17:19,879
I can protect myself, I assure you.

113
00:17:21,679 --> 00:17:24,998
We saw how you protected yourself.

114
00:17:27,779 --> 00:17:30,959
If it wasn't your son Orhan who faced my dagger...

115
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:34,159
...those bandits could not have taken me,
Malhun Hatun.

116
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:38,319
Choose your words wisely
when talking about Orhan Bey.

117
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:42,839
Do not forget he is a Shahzade, Princess Holofira.

118
00:17:43,290 --> 00:17:47,619
I’m sorry, but no one has the right
to tell me what to do in this palace.

119
00:17:47,619 --> 00:17:52,559
If you are our guest here, you will obey my rules.

120
00:17:53,110 --> 00:17:58,879
You won't talk to Saadet Hatun during your visit.
You won't go to the frontiers marketplace.

121
00:17:59,540 --> 00:18:06,119
But... as you said... I am a guest, not a slave.

122
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:11,919
And I will not live by following someone's rules.

123
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:16,039
That's not how I was raised.

124
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:25,479
What are you doing, sister?

125
00:18:25,880 --> 00:18:29,239
Brother.. You scared me.

126
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,639
What are you doing here?

127
00:18:33,950 --> 00:18:39,239
Don't even ask.
My mother is questioning Holofira.

128
00:18:40,170 --> 00:18:43,919
Apparently she will send Holofira, brother.

129
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:50,479
Why? Did something happen at the table?
-I should tell you.

130
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:54,599
Forget Holofira.

131
00:19:03,560 --> 00:19:06,839
Can I come in, mother?

132
00:19:16,320 --> 00:19:22,599
Orhan! Get ready.
You will take her to her land as soon as possible.

133
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:33,839
Holofira!

134
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:40,999
Holofira! Wait.

135
00:19:43,560 --> 00:19:48,439
-What do you want, Orhan?
-What did my mother tell you?

136
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:54,799
She is expecting me to obey your rules.
But tell her, I am never going to follow your rules.

137
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:57,879
Calm down.

138
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:04,559
My mother is not doing that
because she has bad intentions.

139
00:20:05,520 --> 00:20:09,839
I know. I know.

140
00:20:12,760 --> 00:20:15,959
We both want the same thing.

141
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:24,679
My farewell.

142
00:20:26,400 --> 00:20:30,519
So? When am I leaving?

143
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:35,159
Holofira...

144
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:43,959
Go to your room. I will go to my father
and come back. We will talk.

145
00:20:57,040 --> 00:20:59,679
Walk! Walk!

146
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:04,359
-Let me go!
-Come on! Walk!

147
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:10,959
My Shahzade...
He was hiding in a corner and writing this.

148
00:21:20,760 --> 00:21:23,559
Yakup Bey's son Mehmet Bey...

149
00:21:23,880 --> 00:21:32,159
...took Sogut's inn for himself.
Boran Bey must be informed.

150
00:21:41,480 --> 00:21:45,219
Didn't I tell you that
no news will be sent to Yenisehir?

151
00:21:45,219 --> 00:21:47,099
You did, my Bey!

152
00:21:48,160 --> 00:21:53,359
-Who made you write this?
-My Bey, I wrote it!

153
00:22:00,120 --> 00:22:05,759
Take him and make him speak.
Let's see how many spies we have among us.

154
00:22:09,720 --> 00:22:13,199
Swords will not be put back to their sheathes
until the sun rises!

155
00:22:13,890 --> 00:22:17,159
-All Alps will be on alert!
-Yes my Shahzade!

156
00:22:17,630 --> 00:22:20,999
Attention!

157
00:22:30,960 --> 00:22:34,519
I prepared everything in advance,
I thought we would stay here.

158
00:22:35,010 --> 00:22:38,679
-They are all from Germiyan.
-You thought well.

159
00:22:38,960 --> 00:22:42,479
You became a mountain behind us.
Thank you Mehmed.

160
00:22:42,680 --> 00:22:47,479
If Osman Bey made a move,
this mountain would crash him.

161
00:22:49,560 --> 00:22:53,279
What is his intention, my Bey?
He can't have invited you for dinner.

162
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:57,639
He is trying to take revenge for his reputation
which I destroyed.

163
00:22:57,800 --> 00:23:00,919
He will not let it go.

164
00:23:01,840 --> 00:23:05,679
Osman has Remus.

165
00:23:14,760 --> 00:23:16,759
Remus...

166
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:26,479
It leads to the palace's yard. Osman is there.

167
00:23:33,360 --> 00:23:38,079
Come, Remus. Come.

168
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:46,879
You know what happened between
us and Yakup Bey. But...

169
00:23:48,080 --> 00:23:56,919
...if he is telling the truth, if Remus is working for
the infidels and working with crusaders...

170
00:23:57,640 --> 00:24:03,279
There is nothing impossible, my Bey.
We've witnessed many games.

171
00:24:03,880 --> 00:24:07,519
Therefore, we will be careful.

172
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:11,639
We will think about this before we make a move.

173
00:24:13,080 --> 00:24:16,999
We will keep making our moves about Yakup Bey.
We will not stop.

174
00:24:17,080 --> 00:24:20,079
-What are we going to do, my Bey?
-First..

175
00:24:20,200 --> 00:24:23,879
...We will not let them surround Yenisehir
like that again.

176
00:24:24,441 --> 00:24:28,630
Our patrol Alps will also be careful
about the other Alps outside.

177
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:33,919
My Bey... I think what we should do is obvious.

178
00:24:34,160 --> 00:24:39,359
Now this issue has turned into a reputation issue.

179
00:24:40,320 --> 00:24:45,159
My Bey. How do people know you in this land?

180
00:24:45,800 --> 00:24:53,239
Aren't you the head of Ghazis?
Let's fight, my Bey. Let's conquer lands!

181
00:24:54,360 --> 00:24:59,759
You said 'Let Germiyan protect us'
when we made this decision.

182
00:25:00,440 --> 00:25:05,119
-Why do you want to fight now, Bayindir Bey?
-Orhan Bey...

183
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:11,639
Our Bey asked, and we explained our opinion.

184
00:25:12,280 --> 00:25:17,799
We chose our way years ago...
Our way...

185
00:25:17,920 --> 00:25:21,479
...is the way of conquest behind our Bey.

186
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:26,119
Thank you. That's what suits us.

187
00:25:28,440 --> 00:25:32,279
Let them play their games, we will move forward.

188
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:37,319
We will! But Yakup Bey knew
what was going to happen to him.

189
00:25:37,480 --> 00:25:42,799
He surrounded the city and then came here.
He knew we had Remus.

190
00:25:47,520 --> 00:25:49,129
If he didn't have Remus...

191
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:52,650
He wouldn't be able find the courage
to sit on the table with sword.

192
00:25:52,650 --> 00:25:55,399
-What do you mean he came with sword?
-Mehmed, hold on.

193
00:25:55,560 --> 00:26:01,639
It's not the time to stop. You said he has Remus.
What are we going to do if he makes him talk?

194
00:26:01,760 --> 00:26:05,559
-I’ll break Yenisehir down.
-Mehmed!

195
00:26:05,680 --> 00:26:08,319
Listen to me my Bey!

196
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:19,239
He already talked to Remus,
seeing that he confronted us.

197
00:26:20,720 --> 00:26:23,799
But his power was not enough for this.

198
00:26:25,160 --> 00:26:30,519
Son, if we kill Osman...

199
00:26:31,200 --> 00:26:35,719
...we will have to deal with...

200
00:26:36,840 --> 00:26:38,929
...Akinji and Gaziyan.

201
00:26:40,254 --> 00:26:41,844
Our Sultanate...

202
00:26:42,960 --> 00:26:47,599
...wouldn't be in legitimate terms.
First of all,

203
00:26:48,480 --> 00:26:52,759
...we will ruin his reputation
little by little.

204
00:26:53,760 --> 00:26:59,319
So that his people will come one by one...

205
00:27:00,280 --> 00:27:02,999
...and stand behind us.

206
00:27:05,200 --> 00:27:10,959
Osman will make conquests
to boost his reputation.

207
00:27:11,080 --> 00:27:12,799
To where?

208
00:27:17,840 --> 00:27:20,559
Yakup Bey has surrounded as all around.

209
00:27:20,800 --> 00:27:25,079
He is ruining our reputation,
trying to break down our walls.

210
00:27:25,360 --> 00:27:30,719
But we will break
his siege with conquests.

211
00:27:31,000 --> 00:27:33,679
To where, my Bey?

212
00:27:35,360 --> 00:27:37,999
-Let's move towards Kestel.
-Right.

213
00:27:38,120 --> 00:27:41,519
We were preparing for Kestel
siege and we ceased it.

214
00:27:41,720 --> 00:27:44,239
We will start right away,
with Allah's permission.

215
00:27:45,100 --> 00:27:46,479
No.

216
00:27:48,600 --> 00:27:51,239
We will not move towards Kestel.

217
00:27:51,960 --> 00:27:54,639
What's your order, my Bey?

218
00:28:07,520 --> 00:28:09,919
We will go to the place...

219
00:28:10,440 --> 00:28:14,119
...where evil started and
they ruined our reputation,

220
00:28:14,320 --> 00:28:17,159
...we will go to Lefke.

221
00:28:18,840 --> 00:28:22,399
We will punish those who did this to us.

222
00:28:23,880 --> 00:28:27,639
This is a challenge for sultanship.
There's no turning back.

223
00:28:41,560 --> 00:28:45,199
Osman was preparing to move towards
Kestel before Sultan died.

224
00:28:45,360 --> 00:28:47,919
Not Kestel...

225
00:28:49,920 --> 00:28:54,799
...he will go to the castle
where he lost his reputation,

226
00:28:55,600 --> 00:28:59,479
-To Lefke.
-Are we going to let him do that, my Bey?

227
00:28:59,760 --> 00:29:02,239
Of course we will not.

228
00:29:02,560 --> 00:29:06,479
-Kanyumaz
-Yes, my Sultan.

229
00:29:06,800 --> 00:29:10,319
Go to the tribe Beys under the rule of Kayis.

230
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:15,679
No one will reinforce Alps to Osman.

231
00:29:16,480 --> 00:29:19,479
I'll deem them as my enemy if they do so.

232
00:29:19,600 --> 00:29:23,839
-Let them know.
-Yes, my Sultan.

233
00:29:28,570 --> 00:29:34,119
Osman will try to do everything
to save his reputation.

234
00:29:34,800 --> 00:29:38,359
I'll be against hem at his every move.

235
00:29:38,720 --> 00:29:42,359
He wouldn't do it just for his reputation.

236
00:29:43,920 --> 00:29:46,519
Osman’s real purpose is not to obey.

237
00:29:46,680 --> 00:29:50,999
A flock with two shepherds
will either attack each other...

238
00:29:51,280 --> 00:29:54,639
...or jackals hunt them down.

239
00:29:59,280 --> 00:30:02,559
My people do not deserve this.

240
00:30:04,120 --> 00:30:06,919
Osman is being persistent about it.

241
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:10,559
If he does not obey...

242
00:30:12,040 --> 00:30:15,559
...I'll destroy his palace.

243
00:30:17,160 --> 00:30:19,799
Tomorrow will be a long day.

244
00:30:20,400 --> 00:30:22,359
Come on.

245
00:30:26,000 --> 00:30:29,559
Osman Bey!

246
00:30:45,360 --> 00:30:50,199
-Remus?
-My Bey, he escaped the dungeon.

247
00:30:50,720 --> 00:30:52,759
And when I saw the arrow...

248
00:30:56,080 --> 00:31:00,719
How did this happen?
No one but Veysel saw him.

249
00:31:01,440 --> 00:31:05,159
Aren't you their leader? Answer me!

250
00:31:06,120 --> 00:31:09,879
They are trying to kill me in our own palace!

251
00:31:12,600 --> 00:31:18,129
We're trying to save and fix our reputation!

252
00:31:20,120 --> 00:31:23,799
-It will not happen again my Bey.
-It will not happen again! Look at me!

253
00:31:24,120 --> 00:31:26,599
You'll find out who did this.

254
00:31:26,720 --> 00:31:32,919
If there's a spy inside,
you'll find out each one of them.

255
00:31:33,280 --> 00:31:35,479
Go away!

256
00:31:40,840 --> 00:31:43,839
Give his reward.

257
00:31:52,520 --> 00:31:59,839
It was a great move. You'll be rewarded
either with coin or position.

258
00:32:08,610 --> 00:32:10,349
Holofira.

259
00:32:13,850 --> 00:32:15,459
Holofira.

260
00:32:17,440 --> 00:32:19,959
Are you asleep?

261
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:26,439
Very well, I'm leaving then.

262
00:32:30,680 --> 00:32:32,999
I know you're there.

263
00:32:34,160 --> 00:32:36,439
Look, I have an important news for you.

264
00:32:36,519 --> 00:32:40,509
But I guess you're not curious
as you're not answering the door!

265
00:32:41,920 --> 00:32:46,239
Very well, I’m leaving then.

266
00:33:01,160 --> 00:33:05,439
What's that? What will you say?

267
00:33:12,440 --> 00:33:16,919
I'm talking to you.
What's that important thing?

268
00:33:26,800 --> 00:33:31,939
Did my mother upset you?

269
00:33:34,800 --> 00:33:38,719
Was that the important thing?

270
00:33:43,800 --> 00:33:50,359
Very important.
Is there anything more important than this?

271
00:33:52,160 --> 00:33:58,239
-You liar.
-Holofira, wait.

272
00:33:59,360 --> 00:34:04,999
Holofira, tell me.
You were not upset, were you?

273
00:34:06,360 --> 00:34:12,679
Look, my mother talks harshly, but...

274
00:34:13,200 --> 00:34:17,759
-...actually...
-No one can upset me, Shahzade.

275
00:34:19,560 --> 00:34:25,599
Your mother does not know me yet.

276
00:34:28,360 --> 00:34:32,199
Actually, you know what?

277
00:34:33,280 --> 00:34:36,759
You don't know me either.

278
00:34:38,800 --> 00:34:42,479
And that's the issue.

279
00:34:50,280 --> 00:34:59,989
I’m not a dove you can put in a cage.
I'm not a slave who would do everything I'm told to do.

280
00:35:01,360 --> 00:35:03,319
I'm Holofira.

281
00:35:09,680 --> 00:35:17,389
I will not stay here for long.
Make preparations, Shahzade Orhan.

282
00:35:34,440 --> 00:35:44,559
You can't be a dove anyway.
You have claws, daughter of the Lord.

283
00:35:56,000 --> 00:36:00,839
My Osman, table is ready.

284
00:36:01,120 --> 00:36:08,239
Thank you Malhun, thank you.
However, I do not want it right now.

285
00:36:08,680 --> 00:36:12,999
Osman, I have to tell you something.

286
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:19,799
You have to talk with Orhan.
He is in love with Holofira, but it can not happen.

287
00:36:20,160 --> 00:36:25,759
You have to convince him.
Holofira is not muslim.

288
00:36:26,160 --> 00:36:32,119
Why are you saying this?
What if she becomes a muslim?

289
00:36:32,760 --> 00:36:38,839
I hope so, I hope it happens
the way you say, but I know what I see.

290
00:36:38,960 --> 00:36:44,839
The girl is fanatic Christian.
Wears a cross up to her feet.

291
00:36:45,960 --> 00:36:49,839
So you're saying there's no chance?

292
00:36:50,200 --> 00:36:56,999
That is not the only matter.
She grew up comfortably. Knows no boundaries.

293
00:36:57,160 --> 00:37:02,519
I say we find a good
Turkmen girl for Orhan.

294
00:37:02,680 --> 00:37:07,839
Don't get me involved in this.
You can figure this out with Orhan.

295
00:37:07,960 --> 00:37:13,919
-What will happen then, if you don't say anything?
-I am heading to conquest.

296
00:37:14,280 --> 00:37:19,519
The rest is yours. Now tell me,
are the goods ready to go to bazaar?

297
00:37:19,920 --> 00:37:25,279
They are ready.
Saadet Hatun is probably waiting for us.

298
00:37:25,680 --> 00:37:32,159
Their intentions is to stomp us.
Do not ever kneel to Saadet Hatun.

299
00:37:32,280 --> 00:37:37,719
stay so strong in that bazaar that,
make it unbearable for them.

300
00:37:37,840 --> 00:37:44,599
-So that they understand they can't hurt us.
-Do not worry, she doesn't know me yet.

301
00:37:44,880 --> 00:37:53,079
Then, introduce yourself to me.

302
00:37:58,680 --> 00:38:04,479
One asks when will I go,
the other asks when will I bring them.

303
00:38:04,640 --> 00:38:10,959
-Brother, why are you talking to yourself?
-There is no escape from you, is there sister?

304
00:38:11,080 --> 00:38:18,759
Don't offend me brother. I am telling you,
I've got the solution to your problem.

305
00:38:19,120 --> 00:38:25,199
-How?
-Don't you want to convince mother to let Holofira stay?

306
00:38:26,000 --> 00:38:29,399
Ayse Hatun.

307
00:38:31,200 --> 00:38:33,399
Give me.

308
00:38:43,640 --> 00:38:46,879
Sister.

309
00:38:48,320 --> 00:38:52,519
Is this how I wjll convince my mother?
With flowers and love?

310
00:38:52,720 --> 00:39:01,839
Oh brother. When you can't even convince
Mother Malhun, how will you convince Holofira?

311
00:39:02,120 --> 00:39:05,999
If I just convince my mother.

312
00:39:08,560 --> 00:39:13,119
Sister, so you say this will work?

313
00:39:13,320 --> 00:39:19,479
Rest lies in your sweet tongue brother.
You can do it, come on.

314
00:39:54,760 --> 00:39:57,479
What happened Gurbuz Alp?
You were going to beat me?

315
00:39:57,640 --> 00:40:02,079
You're carrying the logs, why carry me?

316
00:40:03,560 --> 00:40:06,279
Don't laugh!

317
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:09,519
I carry a brother like you, over my shoulders.

318
00:40:09,640 --> 00:40:14,279
-Come.
-No, no, no!

319
00:40:22,920 --> 00:40:26,359
Alps, Konur Bey.

320
00:40:27,480 --> 00:40:30,439
Alps.

321
00:40:32,000 --> 00:40:33,039
Cumhuriyet Bavrami

322
00:40:33,040 --> 00:40:35,359
I see you're having fun.

323
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:39,239
The logs were supposed to be carried.

324
00:40:39,530 --> 00:40:43,719
We overdone having fun, as we are going to battle.

325
00:40:43,920 --> 00:40:46,599
-With our wrestler here.
-We missed it Bey.

326
00:40:46,720 --> 00:40:48,879
So you're missing battle.

327
00:40:50,800 --> 00:40:52,999
Tell me..

328
00:40:57,600 --> 00:40:59,079
What else does an Alp want?

329
00:40:59,200 --> 00:41:02,519
To make his enemies scream with his mace.

330
00:41:02,640 --> 00:41:05,279
-Allah is the Greatest!
-Anything else?

331
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:08,359
A soldier's dream is conquest.
He wants to chase that dream.

332
00:41:08,360 --> 00:41:11,119
-Allah is the Greatest!
-Anything else?

333
00:41:11,280 --> 00:41:15,319
A soldier wants to lie on the ground
and become martyr, before lying on his bed.

334
00:41:15,440 --> 00:41:18,359
-Allah is the Greatest!
-And?

335
00:41:18,520 --> 00:41:25,119
Konur Bey, they want conquest,
glory and battle.

336
00:41:25,240 --> 00:41:30,039
-Allah is the Greatest!
-Praise be to the valiants of Osman Bey!

337
00:41:31,920 --> 00:41:36,439
-Praise be!
-However, Konur Bey..

338
00:41:36,600 --> 00:41:41,199
An Alp wants something else..

339
00:41:41,520 --> 00:41:44,719
Even though he doesn't talk about it.

340
00:42:06,360 --> 00:42:10,759
-Am I allowed mother?
-Come in my daughter.

341
00:42:13,960 --> 00:42:18,159
-Mother?
-My Orhan?

342
00:42:19,840 --> 00:42:23,569
Go, go, come on.

343
00:42:24,000 --> 00:42:27,839
I swear, it is working out.
My Sultan!

344
00:42:36,120 --> 00:42:38,639
I am late.

345
00:42:47,960 --> 00:42:51,839
Where do you get these ideas from, Orhan Bey?

346
00:42:52,440 --> 00:42:55,239
No one.

347
00:43:03,480 --> 00:43:07,559
For my mother, I've made them
prepare a special feast.

348
00:43:07,680 --> 00:43:11,439
-So that we can eat together.
-Praise be!

349
00:43:13,600 --> 00:43:16,999
So, tell me..

350
00:43:17,920 --> 00:43:22,479
Speak your mind.
What do you want from me?

351
00:43:29,720 --> 00:43:32,959
Or do you want to marry?

352
00:43:37,520 --> 00:43:46,279
Alright then, we will send word to
all tribes and beyliks, find you a proper bride.

353
00:43:50,840 --> 00:43:53,559
Mother.

354
00:43:54,360 --> 00:43:59,399
What if I'm in love with someone else?

355
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,999
I know what love is, my son.
However, our destiny is written for traditions.

356
00:44:07,200 --> 00:44:11,959
If it was only you,
then I wouldn't have said anything.

357
00:44:13,720 --> 00:44:21,599
However, you are Orhan Bey.
You also carry Osman Bey's state dream.

358
00:44:25,280 --> 00:44:31,559
Yesterday, I understood again that,
that girl is not suitable for you.

359
00:44:32,480 --> 00:44:38,239
After you come back from the mission,
you will take Holofira to home.

360
00:44:39,200 --> 00:44:43,199
That guest has overstayed.

361
00:44:50,120 --> 00:44:52,439
Mother.

362
00:44:53,200 --> 00:44:58,999
-I only want time from you.
-It'll be harder for you as more time passes.

363
00:45:00,200 --> 00:45:02,919
Do what I told you, Orhan Bey.

364
00:45:26,480 --> 00:45:29,189
Oh my son.

365
00:45:31,560 --> 00:45:34,439
I only think about your own good.

366
00:45:48,520 --> 00:45:53,479
It is the command of the grand Bey, Osman Bey.

367
00:45:53,600 --> 00:46:00,599
Those who join the conquest
will be given subsistence.

368
00:46:00,880 --> 00:46:08,079
So that, their eagerness
for battle increases.

369
00:46:08,200 --> 00:46:11,359
Thanks to Osman Bey.

370
00:46:11,600 --> 00:46:17,959
As long as hearty,
real valiants stand beside him..

371
00:46:18,200 --> 00:46:24,359
Osman Bey and his heritage, will live long.

372
00:46:24,600 --> 00:46:28,239
Come on take it. Take it.

373
00:46:30,440 --> 00:46:33,719
He liked gold before, now he likes giving it.

374
00:46:34,370 --> 00:46:38,109
The right way turns people, my Bey.

375
00:46:48,200 --> 00:46:50,759
What’s the matter, my Shahzade?

376
00:47:00,480 --> 00:47:02,479
My brother.

377
00:47:06,560 --> 00:47:09,319
-Brother!
-Brother!

378
00:47:11,080 --> 00:47:13,399
-Did you handle it, brother?
-Thanks to Allah.

379
00:47:13,600 --> 00:47:16,879
-I came back victorious.
-Praise be!

380
00:47:17,760 --> 00:47:20,879
Let's go to father!

381
00:47:50,120 --> 00:47:52,759
When the frontier market is opened,

382
00:47:53,240 --> 00:47:58,239
...Turkmen having tough times
for long time will be at ease.

383
00:47:58,520 --> 00:47:59,919
Everybody...

384
00:48:00,120 --> 00:48:03,559
...is glad that the frontier market is opened, Yakup Bey.

385
00:48:03,680 --> 00:48:08,599
Sons of Oghuz will be united thanks to you.

386
00:48:08,960 --> 00:48:12,279
The unity will prevail forever, Karesi Bey.

387
00:48:12,600 --> 00:48:17,039
There will be objecting voices. I know that.

388
00:48:17,080 --> 00:48:22,799
Those who listens to objecting voices
instead of Yakup Bey's strong voice...

389
00:48:22,920 --> 00:48:25,279
...will lose eventually.

390
00:48:25,520 --> 00:48:30,399
Osman hesitates to pledge loyalty.

391
00:48:30,640 --> 00:48:36,079
-You mean him, huh, Yakup Bey?
-Fighting to be free...

392
00:48:36,640 --> 00:48:39,759
...instead of being united...

393
00:48:41,160 --> 00:48:44,919
...will damage us more than
the enemy will do.

394
00:48:45,560 --> 00:48:50,959
Osman is closed by his arrogance.

395
00:48:51,160 --> 00:48:56,159
He will either open them or...

396
00:48:56,920 --> 00:48:59,919
-Father!
-Gonca.

397
00:49:05,800 --> 00:49:11,399
-Did you bring it, dear?
-I brought the firman, my bey father.

398
00:49:19,480 --> 00:49:21,999
My victorious daughter.

399
00:49:34,120 --> 00:49:37,639
Nobody can stand against me now.

400
00:49:46,200 --> 00:49:49,679
-My Bey father.
-Welcome, son.

401
00:49:52,720 --> 00:49:55,879
Thank you, my Bey. Thank you.

402
00:50:04,080 --> 00:50:06,959
The map leading to the treasure, my Bey.

403
00:50:10,160 --> 00:50:13,759
You accomplished the mission, huh?

404
00:50:16,680 --> 00:50:19,559
-Thank you.
-Thank you, my Bey.

405
00:50:35,690 --> 00:50:39,199
The location of the treasure is drawn
here step by step, my Bey.

406
00:50:42,749 --> 00:50:47,949
Sultan Mesut kept the treasure that
he hid from Mongolians in these frontiers...

407
00:50:48,430 --> 00:50:51,029
...not in Konya.

408
00:50:54,320 --> 00:50:59,009
Around Karamese.
Under the high tree.

409
00:51:00,720 --> 00:51:03,479
Around Karamese?

410
00:51:04,000 --> 00:51:07,559
-Why didn't you bring it, son?
-They followed me, my Bey.

411
00:51:07,640 --> 00:51:11,959
-Who?
-Gonca Hatun, Yakup Bey's daughter.

412
00:51:12,720 --> 00:51:15,599
She knows I got the map.

413
00:51:17,920 --> 00:51:22,799
But there is more. Gonca Hatun was there.

414
00:51:23,360 --> 00:51:28,479
Sultan Mesud used his seal before he died.

415
00:51:31,280 --> 00:51:36,439
How come?
Did she make a dying man use his seal?

416
00:51:37,640 --> 00:51:41,879
If a lion falls, wolves take bites, Orhan Bey.

417
00:51:42,640 --> 00:51:49,119
He sealed the paper to promote his sultanate.
He said he'd declare his sultanate next day.

418
00:51:50,040 --> 00:51:57,319
Anyway, this treasure is what matters now.
It's the only thing to break Yakup Bey's power.

419
00:52:02,400 --> 00:52:05,919
We will take it.

420
00:52:06,280 --> 00:52:09,119
BismillahirRahmanirRahim.

421
00:52:10,000 --> 00:52:16,159
You shouldn't protect only your lives, but also the state.
And it's Germiyanoglu Yakup Bey who Is to protect it.

422
00:52:16,600 --> 00:52:21,839
You shall all pledge loyalty and stand behind him.

423
00:52:21,960 --> 00:52:25,119
This is my last will for you.

424
00:52:26,760 --> 00:52:33,359
This is what you've been dreaming of, my Bey.
Both the throne and power are yours now.

425
00:52:33,920 --> 00:52:37,959
We did this... But is it unfair, father?

426
00:52:39,880 --> 00:52:45,919
Who else but your father deserves this?
Why would it be unfair?

427
00:52:47,160 --> 00:52:52,119
My good-mannered and conscientious daughter.

428
00:52:53,760 --> 00:53:01,479
You think I didn't think about this?
Sometimes, for power...

429
00:53:01,800 --> 00:53:05,479
...everything can be justified.

430
00:53:06,080 --> 00:53:12,039
And tell me my pretty Gonca.
In these lands...

431
00:53:12,120 --> 00:53:15,959
...are there anyone stronger than Germiyan?

432
00:53:16,280 --> 00:53:21,559
Sstrength is what provides peace.

433
00:53:24,560 --> 00:53:31,879
If I hadn't made this move, there would be a blood bath.

434
00:53:32,120 --> 00:53:34,639
I know, my bey father.

435
00:53:35,440 --> 00:53:38,799
But there is another matter.

436
00:53:40,160 --> 00:53:44,199
-Not good, daughter?
-No, father.

437
00:53:46,080 --> 00:53:48,919
Osman's son Alaaddin...

438
00:53:49,120 --> 00:53:54,399
Sultan Mesud left the map of Konya treasure
to him before he died.

439
00:53:54,520 --> 00:53:59,439
-Why didn't you follow him, Gonca?
-Of course I did, my bey father.

440
00:53:59,840 --> 00:54:03,679
But he noticed I was following
and didn't go to the treasure.

441
00:54:04,280 --> 00:54:08,879
If Osman gets the treasure,
Beys will grumble...

442
00:54:09,120 --> 00:54:13,479
...questioning why Osman has the map
while you have the firman.

443
00:54:13,800 --> 00:54:21,799
We will prevent this.
We'll have both the firman and the treasure.

444
00:54:22,920 --> 00:54:26,719
Whatever we do, they will absolutely hit back.

445
00:54:26,720 --> 00:54:31,519
For this reason, we'll be cautious. Konur.

446
00:54:31,720 --> 00:54:36,199
-Go to the headquarters with Bayindir Bey.
-As you order, my Bey.

447
00:54:37,160 --> 00:54:41,759
-What about the market? Yakup Bey is awaiting us.
-He will wait for me...

448
00:54:42,520 --> 00:54:45,959
...but see Malhun Hatun instead.

449
00:54:46,680 --> 00:54:50,359
Alaaddin, you go to the frontier market.

450
00:54:50,480 --> 00:54:55,879
Keep your eyes on Yakup Bey.
I want to know about every step of his.

451
00:54:56,240 --> 00:55:00,999
-As you order, my Bey.
-And you, Orhan...

452
00:55:01,240 --> 00:55:07,959
-My Bey.
-You'll go for the treasure. But it's not only us who seeks it.

453
00:55:08,160 --> 00:55:13,599
They will follow you.
Don't come back without the treasure.

454
00:55:13,920 --> 00:55:16,719
As you order, my Bey.

455
00:55:17,920 --> 00:55:21,119
Everybody get to your duties!

456
00:55:22,080 --> 00:55:24,599
Mehmed!

457
00:55:25,080 --> 00:55:30,039
Osman will want to capture the treasure
before I get my sultanate declared.

458
00:55:30,720 --> 00:55:34,199
Keep your eyes on him!

459
00:55:34,600 --> 00:55:39,119
As my Bey orders.
I will crush whoever stands in my way.

460
00:55:42,000 --> 00:55:44,639
Do I have permission, my Sultan?

461
00:55:44,840 --> 00:55:47,839
Come, Kanyumaz!

462
00:55:49,960 --> 00:55:55,639
My Sultan, Remus got killed
while escaping from Osman's palace last night.

463
00:55:56,040 --> 00:56:01,439
Good. Good.
It wouldn't be good for us if he were alive.

464
00:56:02,160 --> 00:56:05,959
I knew Osman had him.

465
00:56:06,480 --> 00:56:09,799
Dead or alive...

466
00:56:10,640 --> 00:56:16,639
He mentioned me and what?
Could Osman beat me?

467
00:56:17,360 --> 00:56:20,999
Was he able to point his sword at me?

468
00:56:24,280 --> 00:56:29,599
Those who fail to shut their mouths will pass away.

469
00:56:32,070 --> 00:56:33,269
Kanyumaz.

470
00:56:36,120 --> 00:56:42,039
Find Cerkutay, one of Osman's alps,
and bring him to me.

471
00:56:42,120 --> 00:56:44,759
As you order, my Bey.

472
00:57:42,480 --> 00:57:47,679
Osman is going out.
Inform Jesus' children.

473
00:57:47,800 --> 00:57:52,279
Tell them to set a trap against Osman. He should learn..

474
00:57:53,080 --> 00:57:57,879
...that nowhere is safe for him.

475
00:57:58,040 --> 00:58:02,959
He should know that Turks
won't be able to sleep in peace now.

476
00:58:18,440 --> 00:58:23,679
-Atmaca...
-You called me, master Vasilis.

477
00:58:23,880 --> 00:58:28,879
Osman will take the treasure.
You will go and inform Yakup.

478
00:58:29,080 --> 00:58:33,079
The treasure is around Karamese.

479
00:58:33,200 --> 00:58:38,199
That place will be turned into a bloodbath soon, Master Vasilis.

480
00:58:39,120 --> 00:58:43,359
They will drown each other in that blood.

481
00:59:09,040 --> 00:59:15,319
What happened, you mother's boy?
Couldn't you convince your mother?

482
00:59:16,680 --> 00:59:20,599
What does that mean?
Why would I convince her?

483
00:59:20,880 --> 00:59:25,719
You were the same when you were a child.
You could never lie.

484
00:59:28,640 --> 00:59:34,999
But I know.
Your mother is disturbed by my presence.

485
00:59:35,120 --> 00:59:38,399
Send me back to my land, Orhan.

486
00:59:39,800 --> 00:59:43,719
Your mother will be happy,
I'll be happy as well.

487
00:59:43,880 --> 00:59:50,159
You will get what you want.
But you have to wait for some more time.

488
00:59:50,720 --> 00:59:55,439
-The roads...
-Sure. The roads...

489
00:59:57,200 --> 01:00:02,199
Tell me. Why do you want me here?

490
01:00:08,240 --> 01:00:13,869
Now you are playing with me Holofira.
Don't you know why?

491
01:00:17,040 --> 01:00:22,359
My Shahzade. Forgive me. Alps are ready.
They are waiting for your orders.

492
01:00:22,800 --> 01:00:27,919
I'm coming Dark Ali. I'm coming.

493
01:00:32,240 --> 01:00:34,189
Keep running.

494
01:00:42,840 --> 01:00:46,639
It is time. Come on!

495
01:01:02,320 --> 01:01:06,159
-My Bey!
-Come in.

496
01:01:08,000 --> 01:01:12,159
My Bey. We received news from Yenisehir's watchmen.

497
01:01:12,400 --> 01:01:17,479
-What is Osman Bey doing now?
-He is building an army to walk to Lefke.

498
01:01:19,160 --> 01:01:22,079
He should gain his reputation back first!

499
01:01:22,200 --> 01:01:26,599
If he gains a victory,
his reputation will be glorious again.

500
01:01:28,640 --> 01:01:32,879
-We knew he would go to Lefke.
-I should go and take the treasure.

501
01:01:33,120 --> 01:01:37,279
-I should ruin all their opportunities.
-Stop there

502
01:01:40,480 --> 01:01:48,599
We will make such a move that..
. we will turn the world into hell for him.

503
01:01:49,520 --> 01:01:53,439
First, you will go to the bannerless.

504
01:01:54,120 --> 01:01:57,639
You will make them obey Osman.

505
01:01:57,840 --> 01:02:01,119
What is your aim, my Bey?

506
01:02:02,360 --> 01:02:06,999
I prevented him from gathering Alps.

507
01:02:08,040 --> 01:02:14,079
Osman will have to accept the Bannerless.

508
01:02:15,240 --> 01:02:23,479
If he goes and gains a victory with bandits,
what will people say about him, Hatun?

509
01:02:24,640 --> 01:02:31,719
One needs bravery to be a Bey.
But if you are going to be a Sultan...

510
01:02:31,960 --> 01:02:37,519
...you must be smarter than everyone.
I am proud of you, my Bey.

511
01:02:37,760 --> 01:02:41,399
We have just started, my Saadet.

512
01:02:42,160 --> 01:02:48,439
I will ruin Osman's dreams about conquests.

513
01:03:04,680 --> 01:03:10,239
What happened here? Are you alright?
Who did this to you?

514
01:03:11,240 --> 01:03:13,639
-Alps, bring some water.
-Dumrul, come on!

515
01:03:13,639 --> 01:03:14,639
Trap.

516
01:03:18,960 --> 01:03:22,239
I will not leave you here.

517
01:04:01,400 --> 01:04:04,599
I will not let jackals torture the innocent ones.

518
01:04:47,040 --> 01:04:49,309
Showing mercy to the cruel...

519
01:04:51,320 --> 01:04:53,369
...is betraying the poor.

520
01:05:02,640 --> 01:05:06,239
My Bey...
What if this is Yakup Bey's game again?

521
01:05:06,640 --> 01:05:08,439
No...

522
01:05:13,600 --> 01:05:15,979
No... No...

523
01:05:19,520 --> 01:05:23,919
They all have marks on their necks.
But they burnt them.

524
01:05:24,240 --> 01:05:28,359
Apparently...
apparently they want them to infiltrate us.

525
01:05:30,000 --> 01:05:32,959
From now on,
I have suspicions about everyone. -My Bey...

526
01:05:33,120 --> 01:05:36,799
My Bey, Remus had the same mark on his neck.

527
01:05:37,000 --> 01:05:42,479
They are all working for someone.
But who? We'll see.

528
01:05:44,200 --> 01:05:47,159
Hang on... Hang on.

529
01:05:48,280 --> 01:05:50,839
-Ayaz! -My Bey.
-Take her to the healing house.

530
01:05:51,080 --> 01:05:54,639
-Yes my Bey.
-Hurry.

531
01:06:06,430 --> 01:06:09,940
I found you unexpectedly, Mehmet Bey.

532
01:06:09,940 --> 01:06:16,079
Apparently, you learned something really important.
It's obvious. Tell me, Atmaca.

533
01:06:16,280 --> 01:06:20,919
I did, yes.
I learned something so important that...

534
01:06:21,320 --> 01:06:24,919
...all Beys are after this.

535
01:06:25,080 --> 01:06:28,399
It is worth a lot. It is a secret.

536
01:06:28,600 --> 01:06:34,879
We will evaluate its worth and give you
what you deserve Atmaca. Tell me, cut it short.

537
01:06:35,000 --> 01:06:40,519
-I know where Sultan Mesud's treasure is.
-Tell me. Where is it?

538
01:06:42,040 --> 01:06:47,199
-The treasure is around Karamese.
-How could you get the information which we couldn't get, Atmaca?

539
01:06:47,600 --> 01:06:52,999
I can smell the trophy and know
how to get it, Mehmet Bey.

540
01:06:53,240 --> 01:06:57,279
Alright, Atmaca, alright.

541
01:06:57,440 --> 01:07:01,679
When we take it, you will get your reward.

542
01:07:01,880 --> 01:07:04,359
Thank you.

543
01:07:05,040 --> 01:07:09,799
Okmen!
You will find Christian clothes right away.

544
01:07:10,000 --> 01:07:16,399
-Why do you need Christian clothes?
-You will learn soon, Atmaca.

545
01:07:17,120 --> 01:07:21,599
Don't forget
. The other bannerless won't know about this.

546
01:07:22,200 --> 01:07:25,359
This is a secret between you and me.

547
01:07:25,560 --> 01:07:28,239
Okay.

548
01:07:28,680 --> 01:07:34,839
First, we will visit the Bannerless' place.
They will also have a duty.

549
01:07:35,240 --> 01:07:38,519
Come on.

550
01:08:26,280 --> 01:08:29,518
My Hatun, what are you doing?

551
01:08:30,719 --> 01:08:33,638
I feel very well today, Kismet.

552
01:08:34,440 --> 01:08:39,359
The cure Dervish Effendi
gave me made me feel very good.

553
01:08:39,600 --> 01:08:47,799
It feels fine but how can you heal
if you get up so early. Take it slow.

554
01:08:49,120 --> 01:08:53,799
As I'm lying in bed,
my loved ones are getting upset.

555
01:08:54,360 --> 01:08:57,079
I will not lie down from now on.

556
01:08:58,520 --> 01:09:05,159
-I'll get up.
-If Allah permits, my Hatun. If Allah permits.

557
01:09:05,719 --> 01:09:09,719
You look so beautiful, but...

558
01:09:09,960 --> 01:09:14,079
...who are you getting prepared for?
Where are you going?

559
01:09:31,280 --> 01:09:32,909
Alaca?

560
01:09:38,640 --> 01:09:44,399
Alaca.
What are you doing here?

561
01:09:55,480 --> 01:09:56,909
Bala.

562
01:09:58,240 --> 01:09:59,919
Osman.

563
01:10:03,640 --> 01:10:08,959
How did this happen?
How did you get up?

564
01:10:09,200 --> 01:10:13,429
-Are you all right?
-I'm all right.

565
01:10:15,200 --> 01:10:20,859
I was coming for you. But you acted first.

566
01:10:30,800 --> 01:10:34,299
Tell me, how did this happen?

567
01:10:35,120 --> 01:10:40,159
A,Dervish Effendi prepared a cure.
I've been feeling very well lately.

568
01:10:40,360 --> 01:10:46,439
-Praise be. Who is this Dervish?
-I don't know his name.

569
01:10:48,760 --> 01:10:51,839
What are you doing here?

570
01:10:54,720 --> 01:10:58,639
I'm so surprised
to see you up like this.

571
01:11:01,800 --> 01:11:03,409
Come.

572
01:11:04,630 --> 01:11:10,529
Come here. Since you are well,
let’s take a walk.

573
01:11:13,130 --> 01:11:18,359
You seem quiet.
Did you have a bad dinner?

574
01:11:18,480 --> 01:11:23,439
-Yakup Bey is behind Remus.
-Yakup Bey?

575
01:11:24,160 --> 01:11:28,209
He tried to humiliate you in front of the Beys
and make you kiss his hand.

576
01:11:28,209 --> 01:11:33,139
-What are you going to do?
-I'll do what I need to do.

577
01:11:34,179 --> 01:11:40,349
I'll move towards Lefke. I have not stopped
until now and I will not stop now.

578
01:11:40,869 --> 01:11:45,939
Stopping is not for you.
Don't stop. I wish I could join you as well.

579
01:11:47,269 --> 01:11:49,969
You are always with me. Look.

580
01:11:50,020 --> 01:11:56,699
-You are in my heart.
-Osman, you have a wound. Wait.

581
01:12:02,700 --> 01:12:08,299
What's this wound? What's this?

582
01:12:13,140 --> 01:12:19,219
You've been visiting our hunting ground
much recently, son of Bey.

583
01:12:19,700 --> 01:12:23,659
Why?
Do you have any objection?

584
01:12:25,060 --> 01:12:31,419
We'll tell you whether we have an objection or not,
if you tell us why you're here.

585
01:12:31,900 --> 01:12:35,739
I've brought you a great promise.

586
01:12:35,980 --> 01:12:39,339
From now on,
you will not plunder.

587
01:12:40,780 --> 01:12:45,699
You'll earn more coin
than you ever imagined.

588
01:12:47,420 --> 01:12:53,519
Very well, but tell us how.

589
01:12:57,020 --> 01:13:00,859
What did I tell you?
I said you will obey.

590
01:13:01,140 --> 01:13:05,939
And we didn't respond.

591
01:13:06,100 --> 01:13:09,419
We didn't say we would obey Yakup Bey.

592
01:13:09,700 --> 01:13:15,979
Not to Yakup Bey.
You will obey Osman Bey.

593
01:13:21,100 --> 01:13:24,819
Why would we do that?

594
01:13:41,540 --> 01:13:44,949
I told you. For coin.

595
01:13:46,460 --> 01:13:54,219
You will take your coin from me.
Three chests of gold each time.

596
01:13:54,620 --> 01:14:00,419
You think all these soldiers would be
down for three chests of gold only?

597
01:14:03,020 --> 01:14:08,699
It's not only three chests, of course.
Osman Bey is a soldier of holy war.

598
01:14:08,860 --> 01:14:14,779
When you go to war with him,
you take your share from the loot.

599
01:14:20,740 --> 01:14:27,939
So you expect cattle to run away to the mountain
and you expect grass to run short,

600
01:14:28,260 --> 01:14:31,049
once in a blue moon!

601
01:14:38,340 --> 01:14:43,499
We want five chests of gold each time.

602
01:14:45,340 --> 01:14:46,539
Alps.

603
01:14:53,260 --> 01:14:56,539
Bring one more chest.

604
01:15:06,500 --> 01:15:11,719
Let it be six, not five. Enjoy it.

605
01:15:14,980 --> 01:15:19,339
Are you going to do what I say?

606
01:15:21,900 --> 01:15:31,379
Let's say we said yes. What will you gain from it?
What do you want us to do?

607
01:15:34,620 --> 01:15:38,219
What I want from you...

608
01:15:38,780 --> 01:15:41,859
-My Bala...
-Osman.

609
01:15:42,020 --> 01:15:46,099
I haven't left Sogut for a long time.
I want to join you.

610
01:15:46,500 --> 01:15:51,339
-Of course not, you should get better.
-I'd tell you if I wasn't.

611
01:15:51,540 --> 01:15:54,979
-Believe me, it will be better for me.
-My Bala.

612
01:15:55,380 --> 01:15:58,299
-Don't upset me.
-It's about your health, don't do it.

613
01:15:58,700 --> 01:16:05,059
I know, but I feel very well. You see.

614
01:16:05,620 --> 01:16:11,739
Also I'm not saying that I'll fight.
I just want to come to the outpost and see Alps.

615
01:16:12,380 --> 01:16:17,619
-I should come, right?
-All right, but you will stand behind.

616
01:16:18,420 --> 01:16:22,739
-Promise me.
-I promise you, my Osman.

617
01:16:23,620 --> 01:16:27,899
All right, get ready. Come on.

618
01:16:30,220 --> 01:16:34,379
Kismet Hatun. Can she mount?

619
01:16:34,500 --> 01:16:38,219
Thanks to the One who made us see this day.
She is all right, my Bey.

620
01:16:42,380 --> 01:16:46,419
Allah, Allah.

621
01:16:53,820 --> 01:16:56,679
MashaAllah.

622
01:16:58,140 --> 01:17:02,539
-You are all right.
-I'm all right.

623
01:17:25,980 --> 01:17:28,979
GERMIYNAOGULLARI BORDER

624
01:17:29,540 --> 01:17:34,179
Everyone will surge into
this marketplace, Cerkutay.

625
01:17:34,340 --> 01:17:40,579
Not only Germiyans,
all of the Turkmens will make profit.

626
01:17:41,020 --> 01:17:45,179
This is what makes me happy the most.

627
01:17:45,620 --> 01:17:51,819
MashaAllah, it is an unmatched marketplace.

628
01:17:52,700 --> 01:17:56,309
But forgive me for my curiosity, Yakup Bey.

629
01:17:58,460 --> 01:18:02,619
-Why am I here?
-I want you to...

630
01:18:02,820 --> 01:18:10,699
...be my deputy in this marketplace.
Share my load.

631
01:18:14,460 --> 01:18:19,409
How can I be your deputy?
Don't you see my condition?

632
01:18:23,220 --> 01:18:26,979
I can see.
That's why I'm saying it.

633
01:18:29,500 --> 01:18:34,679
I don't need your arms, I need your mind.

634
01:18:35,729 --> 01:18:39,409
Only you can manage all those things.

635
01:18:42,530 --> 01:18:49,149
Forgive me Yakup Bey,
I don't want any load other than mine.

636
01:18:50,580 --> 01:18:56,899
I'm not saying to take on my load,
I'm just saying to share my load.

637
01:18:57,500 --> 01:19:03,939
I know your trouble.
I like Osman Bey.

638
01:19:05,780 --> 01:19:11,179
The resentment between you two
is not my problem.

639
01:19:13,780 --> 01:19:19,059
Also, I’m saying the whole world
will be here, Cerkutay.

640
01:19:20,980 --> 01:19:26,019
No one knows Mongols and Byzantium
better than you.

641
01:19:26,420 --> 01:19:31,979
If you stay at the bazaar,
I will have nothing to worry.

642
01:19:32,620 --> 01:19:38,179
I want this not for myself,
but for everyone.

643
01:19:39,500 --> 01:19:46,899
I don't know if I can do this.
After everything that happened.

644
01:19:47,540 --> 01:19:53,579
I don't accept anyone else as my agent,
Cerkutay.

645
01:19:54,100 --> 01:19:59,139
From now on,
your word here is my word.

646
01:20:01,699 --> 01:20:04,219
Lefke Headquarters

647
01:20:04,660 --> 01:20:06,539
Alps!

648
01:20:08,780 --> 01:20:10,899
Turahan.

649
01:20:16,740 --> 01:20:19,419
What's wrong with this camp?

650
01:20:20,580 --> 01:20:26,939
Alps are missing, swords are missing.
What happened here Turahan?

651
01:20:27,300 --> 01:20:31,549
We agreed with all these tribes.

652
01:20:31,980 --> 01:20:36,139
There used to be thousands of Alps here,
where are they?

653
01:20:36,460 --> 01:20:41,339
The situation is not good, Yakup Bey..

654
01:20:41,580 --> 01:20:48,419
He got all the tribes under his command.
So the tribes did not send any Alps.

655
01:20:50,540 --> 01:20:56,099
We never forget the name
nor the face of those who left us behind.

656
01:20:56,300 --> 01:21:00,579
We fight as we can,
but we are few, Konur Bey. What will we do?

657
01:21:00,780 --> 01:21:04,979
Hold on, let me write a letter to all tribes.

658
01:21:05,140 --> 01:21:09,179
There is no such thing as not keeping a promise.

659
01:21:10,660 --> 01:21:16,659
The way of battle needs heart.
It is more dangerous to have non-believers beside us.

660
01:21:16,860 --> 01:21:23,619
That is true, however,
how are we going to find a solution to this?

661
01:21:24,180 --> 01:21:30,059
-Konur Bey, the bannerless have food.
-Let them come.

662
01:21:54,940 --> 01:22:03,459
Since you came all the way here
put your life in danger, what you'll say is important.

663
01:22:05,540 --> 01:22:08,259
Tell me, why are you here?

664
01:22:08,620 --> 01:22:14,699
From now on, we want to get
under the banner of Osman Bey.

665
01:22:16,460 --> 01:22:20,139
Behold! Cerkutay is coming!

666
01:22:24,420 --> 01:22:30,819
Mother, when will Cerkutay Bey name me?

667
01:22:31,660 --> 01:22:37,339
That is your father.
Don't call him 'Cerkutay Bey’.

668
01:22:37,460 --> 01:22:39,899
Alright.

669
01:22:48,900 --> 01:22:51,859
Come here.

670
01:22:53,980 --> 01:22:57,219
What did you do, my Cerkutay?

671
01:22:58,660 --> 01:23:04,979
Are we going now?
What does Yakup Bey want?

672
01:23:19,380 --> 01:23:22,899
For me to stay at the bazaar.

673
01:23:23,180 --> 01:23:29,219
Bazaar? You did not accept it did you?

674
01:23:32,620 --> 01:23:36,179
Does that belong to us now, mother?

675
01:23:37,740 --> 01:23:42,339
Guard yourselves! Cerkutay Alp is coming!

676
01:23:44,220 --> 01:23:48,619
Cerkutay, don't tell me you said yes.

677
01:23:48,780 --> 01:23:52,699
Look, Yakup Bey and Osman Bey is in conflict.

678
01:23:52,820 --> 01:23:56,219
Do not accept it,
what will you say to Osman Bey?

679
01:23:56,340 --> 01:24:00,099
There is no Osman Bey anymore, Ulgen.

680
01:24:01,860 --> 01:24:07,299
From now on, this bazaar is mine.

681
01:24:09,060 --> 01:24:11,619
It is ours.

682
01:24:12,540 --> 01:24:21,099
My Cerkutay, Yakup Bey tries to
get Alps to his side with tricks, don't..

683
01:24:21,620 --> 01:24:27,699
Who let me out of that prison?
Yakup Bey. Who made us one again?

684
01:24:28,100 --> 01:24:34,299
Yakup Bey.
From now on, our place..

685
01:24:38,820 --> 01:24:40,859
Is with Yakup Bey.

686
01:24:47,700 --> 01:24:55,619
Shahzade Orhan came to you,
asked you to join the battle. You said no.

687
01:24:57,900 --> 01:25:02,139
-Now, what happened?
-Bannerless divided into two.

688
01:25:02,980 --> 01:25:07,979
Those we saw as brothers, betrayed us.

689
01:25:08,140 --> 01:25:11,739
Look at that!

690
01:25:11,980 --> 01:25:17,699
You were betrayed by the men you ate with.

691
01:25:18,580 --> 01:25:23,819
-Why should we have you beside us.
-No.

692
01:25:24,140 --> 01:25:28,499
You think we were defeated from our looks.

693
01:25:30,220 --> 01:25:33,419
We are victorious.

694
01:25:33,820 --> 01:25:38,499
Our goods and hunting grounds are ours.

695
01:25:40,340 --> 01:25:43,619
Then what changed your mind?

696
01:25:44,580 --> 01:25:50,179
-Why do you want to be beside Osman Bey?
-We want to be martyrs.

697
01:25:50,620 --> 01:25:56,579
Not dying by a treacher's knife.

698
01:25:56,900 --> 01:26:03,819
Because of that Atmaca dog,
there is no caravans to hit.

699
01:26:04,140 --> 01:26:09,699
If this goes like this,
we won't make it this winter.

700
01:26:09,820 --> 01:26:18,339
Why don't you say this from the start.
So you want to stand beside us for coin.

701
01:26:19,660 --> 01:26:27,579
Then, those who pay you,
can restrain all of you.

702
01:26:28,180 --> 01:26:33,579
We do not need coin lovers.
We need those that stand beside what we believe.

703
01:26:34,540 --> 01:26:41,619
We can't see through you anyways.
Osman Bey will decide, go wait there.

704
01:27:30,380 --> 01:27:37,419
The sign on the map shows here.
Search around.

705
01:28:06,300 --> 01:28:09,829
We search for a sign of arrow, look sharp.

706
01:28:29,140 --> 01:28:32,299
Alps!

707
01:28:34,340 --> 01:28:36,659
Come on.

708
01:28:49,300 --> 01:28:51,059
Come on.

709
01:28:56,260 --> 01:29:01,939
Atmaca. We won't let him get the treasure.

710
01:29:02,100 --> 01:29:09,179
Treasure belongs to those who want it.
We will give our lives, but not the treasure.

711
01:29:15,460 --> 01:29:20,139
There you are. Get the cart.

712
01:29:20,380 --> 01:29:24,139
e don't know what waits us inside.
Everyone will look sharp.

713
01:29:24,420 --> 01:29:28,459
Alps, you will stay guard at the entrance.

714
01:29:45,740 --> 01:29:49,179
Bring the torch.

715
01:29:53,580 --> 01:30:00,419
-Now is the time.
-Stop, let them go in.

716
01:30:07,980 --> 01:30:12,779
Be careful, come on.

717
01:30:26,260 --> 01:30:29,219
Is that Alaeddin

718
01:30:29,500 --> 01:30:32,979
-Yes, mother.
-What is this Alaeddin like?

719
01:30:33,180 --> 01:30:36,419
As clever as to not to be taken lightly.

720
01:30:36,660 --> 01:30:39,179
Gonca, you are the one saying this?

721
01:30:39,300 --> 01:30:45,579
I couldn't get the map as I took him lightly.
I've tried to trick him many times.

722
01:30:45,820 --> 01:30:51,499
-But he left an empty paper instead of the map.
-You got really angry about this I see.

723
01:30:51,780 --> 01:30:56,699
Don't worry,
I won't let them have the treasure.

724
01:30:58,260 --> 01:31:04,939
I don't worry, father. As you know,
I never forget what was done to me.

725
01:31:05,340 --> 01:31:10,539
-I will not let that go unpunished.
-I know, come on.

726
01:31:10,820 --> 01:31:17,339
Let me see his wit too.
Let's see if he is like you said.

727
01:31:21,860 --> 01:31:27,299
-Welcome, Malhun Hatun.
-Thank you, Yakup Bey.

728
01:31:33,060 --> 01:31:35,499
Cerkutay?

729
01:31:40,500 --> 01:31:46,579
-So, where is Osman Bey?
-He has an important task.

730
01:31:49,220 --> 01:31:55,939
There is no greater task than
to meet in this bazaar, where unites every state.

731
01:31:56,900 --> 01:32:00,879
If there was, we would've done it.

732
01:32:03,500 --> 01:32:08,439
-He will come here as soon as possible.
-Good. Good.

733
01:32:12,160 --> 01:32:15,879
Alaaddin Bey, let's go.

734
01:32:28,320 --> 01:32:33,359
I appreciate your efforts, Saadet Hatun.
The market looks magnificent.

735
01:32:33,760 --> 01:32:37,959
It will be even better
when the trade starts.

736
01:32:38,440 --> 01:32:42,679
Malhun Hatun,
this is your stall.

737
01:32:51,720 --> 01:32:57,679
It seems you love Kayi rugs, Saadet Hatun.
You keep talking about them.

738
01:32:59,280 --> 01:33:04,639
-This is the stall that you think our rugs deserve, huh?
-It's nook or cranny.

739
01:33:05,000 --> 01:33:10,199
-Malhun Hatun, don't you like it?
-Well...

740
01:33:10,800 --> 01:33:15,879
The value of a stall is measured
by its goods not by where it is.

741
01:33:16,000 --> 01:33:21,199
When the goods I got prepared
in Yenisehir arrive, you will know...

742
01:33:21,280 --> 01:33:25,799
...what I mean, Saadet Hatun.

743
01:33:28,800 --> 01:33:34,679
Come here, hatuns.
Meet her. UIgen.

744
01:33:36,280 --> 01:33:41,839
Oh... You already know her, Malhun Hatun.

745
01:34:55,020 --> 01:35:01,779
This way.
In the name of Allah, the merciful, the compassionate.

746
01:35:10,260 --> 01:35:13,379
Gokmen, shoot arrows.

747
01:35:36,220 --> 01:35:40,019
They are after Orhan.

748
01:35:48,460 --> 01:35:54,659
Let's go. We shouldn't lose them.

749
01:35:57,500 --> 01:36:00,459
Orhan, where are you?

750
01:36:16,180 --> 01:36:22,339
Orhan! Orhan! Orhan where are you?

751
01:37:02,500 --> 01:37:05,619
-Take this.
-Thank you.

752
01:37:05,700 --> 01:37:12,219
-Are you a doctor now, Scholar?
-I'm a doctor for those looking for heal, Trickster Hatun.

753
01:37:12,980 --> 01:37:17,059
Watch your words!
When did you even see me doing tricks?

754
01:37:17,500 --> 01:37:22,499
What? You aren't embarrassed while doing tricks
but you are when you're called so?

755
01:37:24,460 --> 01:37:29,379
You always hang out with your mother and sister.
And your brother walks with your father, huh?

756
01:37:29,740 --> 01:37:36,459
Look who is talking! Weren't you supposed to be
preparing silk dowry with your mother in your tent?

757
01:37:36,700 --> 01:37:44,099
-Gonca Hatun, daisy is good for nerves.
You apparently need it.

758
01:37:44,220 --> 01:37:48,139
-Scholar!
-Gonca Hatun.

759
01:37:49,940 --> 01:37:55,819
-Saadet Hatun is awaiting you.
-We aren't done yet, Scholar!

760
01:37:59,400 --> 01:38:05,499
I'm always here, Trickster Hatun.

761
01:38:36,780 --> 01:38:39,019
-My Bey.
-What's the situation?

762
01:38:39,180 --> 01:38:43,059
-Yakup Bey gave an order to tribe beys.
-And?

763
01:38:43,060 --> 01:38:47,059
"Don't provide alps for Osman Bey", he said.

764
01:38:48,500 --> 01:38:54,259
Okay.
When the wolf makes a decision,

765
01:38:54,500 --> 01:39:00,139
...he knows the hunter and the awaiting pain.
No problem.

766
01:39:06,620 --> 01:39:11,459
-Why are The Bannerless here?
-It seems Shahzade's plan worked.

767
01:39:11,940 --> 01:39:17,259
They want to pledge loyalty. They say they want to
fight for Islam and seek no haram anymore.

768
01:39:17,380 --> 01:39:20,939
-But I can send them away.
-I want no pledges!

769
01:39:22,580 --> 01:39:27,259
Go to Yakup Bey! Come on!

770
01:39:27,700 --> 01:39:31,099
Osman Bey! Osman Bey!

771
01:39:31,140 --> 01:39:37,099
We are skillful in the battlefield.
Do no turn us down, Osman Bey.

772
01:39:40,460 --> 01:39:43,459
Germiyanogullari Border

773
01:39:43,500 --> 01:39:51,059
Trading is a blessing.
Blessings come from Allah.

774
01:39:51,180 --> 01:40:00,859
This marketplace, which will make us all happy,
will be open tomorrow, with Allah's permission.

775
01:40:03,420 --> 01:40:11,219
Tribes and cities will bring their goods
to this marketplace and sell them.

776
01:40:11,340 --> 01:40:16,499
Goods will come not only from us,
but also from the east, the west...

777
01:40:16,620 --> 01:40:21,259
...and the land of Persians.

778
01:40:21,460 --> 01:40:29,219
-May it be blessed for all of us!
-Aamen!

779
01:40:29,940 --> 01:40:37,579
Now you are wondering,
who will be in charge of this marketplace?

780
01:40:39,300 --> 01:40:51,259
My valiant, Cerkutay Bey, come here.

781
01:41:03,780 --> 01:41:12,019
He is responsible for this market and he is in control.

782
01:41:13,700 --> 01:41:26,659
A Bey, who has endured all these
years of captivity, will manage this market well.

783
01:41:27,420 --> 01:41:32,099
-Isn't that right, Alaeddin Bey?
-Sure.

784
01:41:32,380 --> 01:41:37,819
You can't find anyone better than
Cerkutay Bey, Yakup Bey.

785
01:41:38,900 --> 01:41:44,099
Congratulations, Cerkutay Bey.

786
01:41:46,900 --> 01:41:55,659
Thanks to Yakup Bey..
He deemed me worthy of this position.

787
01:41:58,020 --> 01:42:09,499
I swear... Sleeping is haram for me until I make
this marketplace the biggest marketplace in the world.

788
01:42:10,660 --> 01:42:25,099
This marketplace is offering us wealth.
And I, with Allah's consent, will achieve this.

789
01:42:27,300 --> 01:42:29,949
And this must be known.

790
01:42:46,500 --> 01:42:55,859
-Send my greetings to Osman Bey, Alaeddin Bey.
-Alaykum Salaam, Yakup Bey.

791
01:42:58,470 --> 01:43:00,439
Cerkutay Bey.

792
01:43:17,220 --> 01:43:21,619
My Shahzade. Yakup Bey
and Beys are leaving on their horses.

793
01:43:21,740 --> 01:43:28,219
We will go after them. Come on.

794
01:43:28,500 --> 01:43:30,909
So you are talented, huh?

795
01:43:35,780 --> 01:43:40,339
Why are you testing Orhan Bey?
Why?

796
01:43:40,660 --> 01:43:46,619
Men do not fight behind a man who is not stronger
than them, Osman Bey. We wanted to see it.

797
01:43:46,780 --> 01:43:51,659
And a man who is weaker than him doesn't
want their accompany!

798
01:43:52,140 --> 01:44:02,659
Now I will test you.
You will face me now. To the field!

799
01:44:09,540 --> 01:44:17,979
The body cannot carry the heart, It is always apart,
Do not stop, the Bannerless! Yell with all your clout!

800
01:44:18,620 --> 01:44:27,459
Say something if you cannot defeat your opponent,
Call your companion... -Hit, hit!

801
01:45:25,820 --> 01:45:37,179
We will part our ways. We will look everywhere.
We will check all the trees! Everywhere! Come on!

802
01:46:36,440 --> 01:46:47,459
The treasure... The treasure is here.
Thanks to You, my Allah. Alps, come here!

803
01:46:50,070 --> 01:46:56,059
-Orhan!
-The treasure...

804
01:46:56,420 --> 01:47:02,099
...the treasure is under this rock.
We will dig here.

805
01:47:03,300 --> 01:47:11,299
-Orhan! Orhan!
-Holofira? Holofira!

806
01:47:12,580 --> 01:47:17,269
-What are you doing here?
-They are after you! -Who?

807
01:47:37,020 --> 01:47:44,419
-Allah is the Greatest!
-The treasure is ours!

808
01:47:48,980 --> 01:47:53,379
-What are you doing here?
-Why do you care, Orhan?

809
01:48:56,460 --> 01:49:02,619
Do not take another step, Scholar.

810
01:49:05,420 --> 01:49:11,059
The next arrow will find your heart.
Get down.

811
01:49:11,500 --> 01:49:18,819
-Trickster Hatun.
-Come on! I said get down!

812
01:49:33,740 --> 01:49:39,099
Tell me... Why are you chasing my horse?

813
01:49:39,100 --> 01:49:44,419
I am on my way. But you never stop
following me, Trickster Hatun.

814
01:49:44,780 --> 01:49:54,179
I asked you a question.
I said, why are you following my horse?

815
01:49:55,540 --> 01:49:59,059
And I asked you.

816
01:50:00,660 --> 01:50:07,059
Why do you keep following me?
Your eyes are always on me.

817
01:50:07,860 --> 01:50:11,589
-Did you...
-Did I what?

818
01:50:13,980 --> 01:50:17,519
Did you fall in love with me?

819
01:51:35,500 --> 01:51:39,929
-They are talented, my Bey.
-And they are brave.

820
01:51:39,929 --> 01:51:43,119
One needs to be brave to fight Osman Bey.

821
01:51:46,010 --> 01:51:55,619
This time, you will come and fight with us.
But you won't take a piece from the trophy.

822
01:51:56,060 --> 01:52:01,979
Let's see if you are really doing that
for the holy cause.

823
01:52:04,660 --> 01:52:10,609
If you play a game,
this will bring your end.

824
01:52:14,620 --> 01:52:28,379
Alps! Everyone will support each other!
We are going to Lefke! Come on!

825
01:52:36,020 --> 01:52:43,419
-Do you trust them?
-No. Those who want gold can do anything for gold.

826
01:52:43,660 --> 01:52:50,179
But if we rejected them,
they would talk behind our backs. Therefore...

827
01:52:50,980 --> 01:52:56,899
...there is no need to offend our veterans.
-You are right. We will keep them in sight.

828
01:52:57,380 --> 01:53:05,379
My Bala... Come on. Forget about that.
Tell me now... Did your sword become rusty?

829
01:53:06,140 --> 01:53:09,699
When did the swords of Sisters become rusty, my Osman?

830
01:54:03,220 --> 01:54:06,779
My Shahzade! Protect the Shahzade! Alps!

831
01:54:08,020 --> 01:54:10,379
My Shahzade!

832
01:54:11,340 --> 01:54:14,339
-Protect the Shahzade!
-Orhan!

833
01:54:18,260 --> 01:54:20,059
Orhan!

834
01:54:20,900 --> 01:54:23,539
Orhan, we need to go!

835
01:54:23,740 --> 01:54:25,179
stand up, come on! -My Alps...

836
01:54:25,380 --> 01:54:27,299
Come with me!

837
01:54:28,620 --> 01:54:31,379
Orhan, they are crowded! I said come on!

838
01:54:31,500 --> 01:54:34,659
Alps! Alps, we are going back!

839
01:54:34,820 --> 01:54:38,059
Go to Karayazi region. We will meet there!

840
01:54:46,980 --> 01:54:48,139
Holofira, my Alps!

841
01:54:48,260 --> 01:54:51,939
Come with me! They are too crowded!

842
01:54:52,380 --> 01:54:54,819
We are going back, Alps!

843
01:55:05,980 --> 01:55:09,259
Go after them! Don't let them run away!

844
01:55:19,780 --> 01:55:22,139
Will we follow them, my Shahzade?

845
01:55:22,260 --> 01:55:25,859
The Bannerless will descend on them like vultures.

846
01:55:26,860 --> 01:55:29,459
We will take the treasure, Okmen.

847
01:55:38,940 --> 01:55:42,659
Sultan Mesud's treasure belongs to Germiyan.

848
01:55:54,820 --> 01:55:58,019
Come. Come.

849
01:56:06,420 --> 01:56:10,139
Are you alright?
Are you alright?

850
01:56:13,380 --> 01:56:15,979
Holofira!

851
01:56:22,900 --> 01:56:25,179
Come with me... Let's go.

852
01:56:25,340 --> 01:56:27,939
Come on.

853
01:56:51,140 --> 01:56:55,099
The trail goes this way. Come on!

854
01:57:00,940 --> 01:57:03,179
Come... Come.

855
01:57:04,740 --> 01:57:06,499
Orhan!

856
01:57:23,140 --> 01:57:25,299
Come on.

857
01:57:31,340 --> 01:57:33,099
Are you alright?

858
01:57:34,740 --> 01:57:36,459
Orhan...

859
01:57:37,380 --> 01:57:41,339
-Holofira...
-We will get out of this place.

860
01:57:56,580 --> 01:57:58,419
Bey's son...

861
01:58:00,820 --> 01:58:02,579
Dervish..

862
01:58:04,180 --> 01:58:06,979
Dervish Efendi..

863
01:58:26,740 --> 01:58:30,499
Orhan... I will find you Orhan.

864
01:58:34,340 --> 01:58:37,339
Germiyanogullari Border

865
01:58:37,580 --> 01:58:41,979
MashaAllah.
Kayi's carpets have been brought.

866
01:58:42,140 --> 01:58:47,119
MashaAllah, they.are so beautiful

867
01:58:47,160 --> 01:58:51,739
Of course, UIgen. Kayi's Hatuns weave the best carpets...

868
01:58:51,860 --> 01:58:53,829
...in the Frontiers.

869
01:58:56,620 --> 01:59:01,339
Saadet Hatun, if you like any of them,
let us give it as a gift.

870
01:59:02,020 --> 01:59:04,219
Come on UIgen.

871
01:59:05,020 --> 01:59:08,219
Pick the most beautiful one.

872
01:59:08,820 --> 01:59:11,219
Show your skills.

873
01:59:23,100 --> 01:59:25,779
Alps, give me a hand.

874
02:00:10,140 --> 02:00:13,899
Your first sale is from us and
the grace Is from Allah.

875
02:00:17,860 --> 02:00:21,819
UIgen, have the carpet ready.

876
02:00:38,420 --> 02:00:42,259
Do you want me to put the carpets in the tent,
Saadet Hatun?

877
02:00:46,140 --> 02:00:48,779
Lay it here.

878
02:00:54,540 --> 02:00:57,099
Come on, lay it out.

879
02:01:48,940 --> 02:01:50,419
Fitnat.

880
02:01:53,780 --> 02:01:56,299
Inform Atmaca.

881
02:01:56,660 --> 02:02:02,219
Malhun Hatun's caravan will not join
the marketplace tomorrow.

882
02:02:05,460 --> 02:02:11,539
You need to put the one who's out of her limits in her place,
so that she cannot lay eyes on your post.

883
02:02:13,100 --> 02:02:19,379
Let's see what she's going to do when
she's ruined and her bench is empty tomorrow.

884
02:02:21,580 --> 02:02:26,699
I'll show you how to be great, Malhun.

885
02:02:39,500 --> 02:02:43,939
She is straight-forwardly insulting us.
Are we going to let her get away with it, mother?

886
02:02:44,060 --> 02:02:46,419
We will not, of course.

887
02:02:46,700 --> 02:02:49,699
I know what to do to the one...

888
02:02:49,940 --> 02:02:53,459
...who puts mud on Kayi's efforts.

889
02:03:15,300 --> 02:03:17,499
What's that?

890
02:03:19,580 --> 02:03:22,939
What are these banners?

891
02:03:26,420 --> 02:03:28,819
Yakup Bey.

892
02:03:29,180 --> 02:03:31,579
Yakup Bey.

893
02:03:50,980 --> 02:03:55,059
Holofira. Give me the sword.

894
02:04:00,060 --> 02:04:02,659
Give me the sword.

895
02:04:09,100 --> 02:04:12,179
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

896
02:05:03,740 --> 02:05:05,409
Thank you Dervish Effendi.

897
02:05:07,940 --> 02:05:10,539
You came here like Khidr.

898
02:05:11,580 --> 02:05:13,219
Don't even mention it.

899
02:05:21,580 --> 02:05:24,859
One escapes everything...

900
02:05:25,140 --> 02:05:28,379
...but cannot escapes his destiny.

901
02:05:33,540 --> 02:05:36,499
Ya Shafi (The One Who cures).

902
02:05:38,460 --> 02:05:43,259
When and where
we will be is predetermined.

903
02:05:47,220 --> 02:05:49,539
The test is also predetermined.

904
02:05:50,180 --> 02:05:54,299
-And questions as well.
-Thank you.

905
02:05:56,100 --> 02:05:58,459
The test is determined.

906
02:05:59,380 --> 02:06:01,619
And questions.

907
02:06:04,140 --> 02:06:07,539
That's right, but the important thing is,

908
02:06:07,820 --> 02:06:10,579
one should not forget that he's being tested.

909
02:06:10,900 --> 02:06:14,779
And that test is intertwined.

910
02:06:17,020 --> 02:06:19,299
You are tested with justice.

911
02:06:20,220 --> 02:06:22,859
You are tested with position.

912
02:06:23,260 --> 02:06:25,819
You are tested with money.

913
02:06:27,980 --> 02:06:30,379
You are tested with love.

914
02:06:37,580 --> 02:06:41,979
You either pass the test and move on,

915
02:06:42,340 --> 02:06:45,699
or you lose your mind along with the test

916
02:06:46,180 --> 02:06:48,979
and turn into a mad man.

917
02:06:57,780 --> 02:07:01,259
Since Haqq made us cross paths,

918
02:07:01,620 --> 02:07:03,939
do you want me to give you a secret?

919
02:07:04,060 --> 02:07:05,739
We do.

920
02:07:10,380 --> 02:07:13,139
I mean, I do.

921
02:07:16,300 --> 02:07:19,379
Please, Dervish Effendi.

922
02:07:32,260 --> 02:07:35,099
This sword

923
02:07:35,420 --> 02:07:40,259
that caused this wound and cauterized it,

924
02:07:40,740 --> 02:07:43,499
just as it is an object,

925
02:07:43,900 --> 02:07:46,419
love is also an object.

926
02:07:48,860 --> 02:07:54,819
And it is such an object that it is too precious to touch.

927
02:07:55,820 --> 02:07:58,899
Neither steel, nor copper,

928
02:07:59,020 --> 02:08:03,899
nor silver, nor gold, nor emeralds, nor rubies.

929
02:08:05,460 --> 02:08:10,139
There's nothing as precious as love.

930
02:08:12,700 --> 02:08:16,899
Love is like a sun.

931
02:08:18,900 --> 02:08:24,339
One without love has a heart similar a rock.

932
02:08:25,140 --> 02:08:27,579
What does heart have to do with stone?

933
02:08:30,860 --> 02:08:34,819
Just as the sun warms the earth

934
02:08:34,940 --> 02:08:37,419
and illuminates the darkness,

935
02:08:37,620 --> 02:08:40,019
so is love.

936
02:08:40,140 --> 02:08:42,499
Makes you experienced.

937
02:08:42,940 --> 02:08:45,379
Boils your blood.

938
02:08:46,300 --> 02:08:48,419
Makes you generous.

939
02:08:49,660 --> 02:08:53,059
Is there a single fruit that doesn't get sunlight?

940
02:08:54,020 --> 02:08:55,739
They die if they don't.

941
02:08:58,460 --> 02:09:03,859
There is no such being that doesn't
get love as well. If they don't, they die.

942
02:09:04,740 --> 02:09:09,499
Since the most precious thing is love..

943
02:09:09,820 --> 02:09:13,499
Then, the hardest task is..

944
02:09:13,860 --> 02:09:17,259
The one you have with it.

945
02:09:21,460 --> 02:09:23,579
Son of Bey.

946
02:09:25,020 --> 02:09:30,939
Now you say, why did you tell me this, Dervish?

947
02:09:31,260 --> 02:09:35,339
The hearts without love, hearts of stone..

948
02:09:35,620 --> 02:09:39,899
They do not give anything
but unrest in this world, that's why.

949
02:09:40,500 --> 02:09:43,859
Now, I tell you this..

950
02:09:44,340 --> 02:09:49,139
So that we stay with love,
we become one of lovers.

951
02:09:49,580 --> 02:09:54,099
The owner of love is no one but Allah.

952
02:09:54,660 --> 02:09:59,859
So that no matter where we look,
we look with the goodwill of Allah.

953
02:10:01,980 --> 02:10:09,339
As only those who look with the goodwill of Allah
can give peace and serenity to this world.

954
02:10:11,020 --> 02:10:13,219
May Allah..

955
02:10:13,620 --> 02:10:18,819
-Allow us to be one of those.
-Aameen.

956
02:10:51,540 --> 02:10:57,379
Make way!
The Sultan of all states, Yakup Bey.

957
02:11:12,620 --> 02:11:16,659
Welcome to Germiyan lands, Osman Bey.

958
02:11:17,820 --> 02:11:20,139
Thank you.

959
02:11:21,220 --> 02:11:24,379
Congrats on your conquest, Yakup Bey.

960
02:11:24,500 --> 02:11:26,939
It was great already.

961
02:12:16,500 --> 02:12:18,819
My dear friend Yakup Bey.

962
02:12:18,940 --> 02:12:22,819
You were of great help to me. Welcome.

963
02:12:23,260 --> 02:12:26,539
Thank youi, Lord Zenon.

964
02:12:26,660 --> 02:12:31,179
-To what do I owe this crowded visit?
-What's the matter?

965
02:12:31,780 --> 02:12:35,099
You don't have the power to feed us all?

966
02:12:36,380 --> 02:12:39,859
Of course, if you are a guest.

967
02:12:40,060 --> 02:12:42,819
Lefka has rich soil.

968
02:12:43,680 --> 02:12:46,119
We know.

969
02:12:46,700 --> 02:12:50,939
However, we do not like being guests.

970
02:12:55,550 --> 02:13:00,869
We own every place we place our foot on.

971
02:13:01,780 --> 02:13:04,579
-Soldiers!
-Ya Allah!

972
02:13:33,580 --> 02:13:38,899
Your home, Lord Zenon, is mine now.

973
02:13:41,620 --> 02:13:46,179
- Allah is the greatest!
- Allah is the greatest!

974
02:13:46,300 --> 02:13:50,339
- Allah is the greatest!
- Allah is the greatest!

975
02:13:50,460 --> 02:13:52,979
Alps, take over the castle.

976
02:13:53,140 --> 02:13:54,939
First..

977
02:13:55,580 --> 02:13:59,059
He imprisoned..

978
02:13:59,059 --> 02:14:01,258
my valiant Cerkutay.

979
02:14:02,380 --> 02:14:04,779
I took vengeance.

980
02:14:07,780 --> 02:14:11,219
Then, he imprisoned the mightiest of my Beys..

981
02:14:11,290 --> 02:14:15,449
Osman Bey.

982
02:14:17,470 --> 02:14:20,389
I took vengeance.

983
02:14:21,890 --> 02:14:25,769
I took out all of them, with Allah's permission.

984
02:14:28,100 --> 02:14:33,339
The way of battle, is the way of all, Osman Bey.

985
02:14:35,420 --> 02:14:38,419
As this fits..

986
02:14:38,660 --> 02:14:40,619
To the Sultan of the State.

987
02:14:43,300 --> 02:14:45,099
However..

988
02:14:46,060 --> 02:14:52,819
You took pillagers beside you,
on your way to Lefka.

989
02:14:54,460 --> 02:14:57,459
Your battle is not holy.

990
02:14:58,180 --> 02:15:00,699
Nor conquest.

991
02:15:01,260 --> 02:15:04,939
But to pillage. Right, Beys?

992
02:15:11,700 --> 02:15:15,059
-Kanyumaz!
-My Sultan.

993
02:15:21,700 --> 02:15:24,779
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

994
02:15:25,700 --> 02:15:32,459
Trust is not only for the heart,
but for the state as well.

995
02:15:33,620 --> 02:15:37,219
And that is, given to Germiyan..

996
02:15:37,420 --> 02:15:40,379
Yakup Bey.

997
02:15:41,500 --> 02:15:45,899
All of you will kneel to Yakup Bey..

998
02:15:46,060 --> 02:15:48,579
And stand beside him.

999
02:15:50,940 --> 02:15:55,499
And that is my final will to you.

1000
02:16:10,940 --> 02:16:13,939
You neither look like grand vizier..

1001
02:16:15,700 --> 02:16:18,259
Nor Mother Sultan.

1002
02:16:18,500 --> 02:16:20,099
That is correct.

1003
02:16:21,801 --> 02:16:26,991
Because none of them were Sultan.

1004
02:16:34,358 --> 02:16:45,768
